a month for the old-style connection, the plug in the wall that you plug the old-style

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:12.320
telephone into, and then you'd pay for broadband on top of that. And as you say, that's gone

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:18.750
up by as much as 41% over the last six years, while the actual cost of the line to the provider

