affected by this are around a million or so who have the landline connection but don't

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:40.080
have the broadband internet connection and don't have a mobile to rely on.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:46.100
So for them the landline is very much a lifeline and it's a preponderance of older people within

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:47.100
